questions.question:
Calculate emf of the half cell given below :

$$\begin{aligned} & \mathrm{Pt}(\mathrm{~s})|\mathrm{H}_2(\mathrm{~g}, 2 \mathrm{~atm})| \mathrm{HCl}(\mathrm{aq}, 0.02 \mathrm{M}) \\ & \mathrm{E}_{\mathrm{H}_2 / \mathrm{H}^{+}}^{\circ}=0 \mathrm{~V} \end{aligned} 

(Given: $\frac{2.303 R T}{F}=0.059, \log 2=0.3010$ )

hi.question:
नीचे दिए गए अर्ध सेल का वि.वा. बल (emf) परिकलित कीजिए :

$$\begin{aligned} & \mathrm{Pt}(\mathrm{~s})|\mathrm{H}_2(\mathrm{~g}, 2 \mathrm{~atm})| \mathrm{HCl}(\mathrm{aq}, 0.02 \mathrm{M}) \\ & \mathrm{E}_{\mathrm{H}_2 / \mathrm{H}^{+}}^{\circ}=0 \mathrm{~V} \end{aligned} 

(दिया गया है : $\frac{2.303 R T}{F}=0.059, \log 2=0.3010$ )

hi.explanation:
$\mathrm{H}_2(\mathrm{~g}) \longrightarrow 2 \mathrm{H}^{\oplus}(\mathrm{aq})+2 \mathrm{e}^{\ominus}$

 \begin{aligned} & \because E=E^{\circ}-\frac{2.303 R T}{n F} \log \frac{[\mathrm{H}^{+}]^2}{\mathrm{P}_{\mathrm{H}_2}} \\ & {[\mathrm{H}^{+}]=0.02 \mathrm{M}(\mathrm{HCl} \text { से })} \\ & P_{\mathrm{H}_2}=2 \mathrm{~atm} \end{aligned} 

 \begin{aligned} & \frac{2.303 R T}{F}=0.059 \\ & E=0-\frac{0.059}{2} \log \frac{(0.02)^2}{2} \\ & =-0.0295 \log (\frac{0.0004}{2}) \\ & E=-0.0295 \log (2 \times 10^{-4}) \\ & =-0.0295(\log 2+\log 10^{-4}) \\ & =-0.0295[0.301-4]=0.109 \mathrm{~V} \end{aligned}$$

